<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">1BIT ARUM</book>
  <para style="h">1 Abitrusu</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Abitrusu</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Abitrusu</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Bit</para>
  <para style="mt2">AMGBASHO ATA JIJI ANYI NA</para>
  <para style="mt1">Abitrusu</para>
  <para style="imt">IKPI TSIFA</para>
  <para style="im">A bu Ablusu mi a ŋa amgbasho ata areh.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1" />Amgbasho ata areh anyi na amya Abitrusu, kyangwri tohmoh Yeso kristi, a na na kyangwri Nnoh mboh ata ŋoh nza a seh mboh reh, amboh ata nza ma a bu sene mboh, ma tuma ma atsetse ma akpokpo nzinzi Fontus, tasa Galatiyawa, tasa Kafadokiya, tasa Asiya, tasa za Bitiniya, <verse eid="1PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2" />ata mata ka a seh ŋoh tswanza Nnoh Ada ta ka a bleh a gya ma agohsoh a ŋoh reh, tasa ta a keshe nnoh a gya ma aki ndohmoh Huru ata zanana. a bu kira a ŋoh mi la ti tufa nnoh aki Yeso kristi, tasa za la mata zanana nimeh mumusu imya a ŋoh.<verse eid="1PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Riri A bu na Nnoh Tsifa Gya agohsoh ata Nza A nati Trina Kpeh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3" />Riri ta a bu na Nnoh reh tasa Ada ata Ada ambohroh Yeso Kristi! nimeh nza kwini a ŋoh gaga a nga reh mara afeh nimeh tuma gya agohsoh ata tuma atono nimeh tsifa gyuru a yiri ata Yeso Kristi nyi kwo reh, <verse eid="1PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4" />tasa ni nati hunji gohmoh ata nza a nati a mishi hwina kpeh, a ka a te abibi kpeh ha ta a kpokprona kpeh ata Nnoh nza a gya reh ma inza. <verse eid="1PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5" />mohnoh amboh ata Nnoh nimeh wuwana a ŋoh a ka a keshe nnoh ma aki nga agohsoh amohnoh. A bu kira a ŋoh mi la ti na ni niye ma hunji nvara ata nza a lisa a nati a vuru a tsana noh na ameh trina inziyo areh. <verse eid="1PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6" />Ma ikpi andromboh alindeh ata areh Nnoh nza a lisa reh, johjoh nnoh gaga, nehnehreh ni buti kputu agohsoh amohnoh, a bu shidi ma, tsifa tsara ma atsetse nza ma a hehndeh a tsara nnoh a nza nza ni bu noh nimeh reh. <verse eid="1PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7" />Areh a ba la gya agohsoh amohnoh ta a bu ajija gya agohsoh. kpakpa hungroh atisha, ata nza ka a vavasana, maka a tsara na shira; tasa a bu dehreh na nga agohsoh amohnoh, ata nza a bu ajija a keh kpakpa hungroh atisha, mata a nati tsara a nza za kanga feh ma sa ariri nnoh, tasa ma sa a nga noh agba tasa ma sa ringa nnoh ma ibi ata Yeso Kristi ta a gyuru a ba. <verse eid="1PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8" />Mata a bu dehreh za ni hehreh nza noh Yeso Kristi kpeh, Neh nambri za dehreh ni kǝ kira nnoh na a ŋoh. A bu dehreh za ni hehreh nza noh nehnehreh kpeh, nambri za dehreh ni nga nnoh kira amohnoh ba na a ŋoh agohsoh amohnoh a kasa na a ŋoh gaga. ata nza a keh aniye ta a wina a bleh kpeh, ata nza a bu na nga johjoh agba, <verse eid="1PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9" />tsifa la ni buti sa nnoh firoh nga agohsoh amohnoh na Yeso nza a bu hunji nvara fene amohnoh reh. <verse eid="1PE 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10" />amboh sa tohmoh anyi na Nnoh a bleh ma ta ka a bleh tsifa ma ikpi la andromboh alindeh a nati bu amohnoh, tama a fa alindeh nimeh amgbasho Nnoh, maka a hunji a wina sehsehseh ila nvara reh ata Nnoh nza a nga noh were. <verse eid="1PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11" />Ma a fa la mboh mata a wina la ha a nati bu ameh mboh andromboh reh ka a nati te, tasa maka a nati lisa lele, na ameh ata Huru Kristi, ata nza atsifa ma agohsoh amoh, a tsana mboh tswanza Kristi nza a wa iya tasa za nga agba nza a tufa . <verse eid="1PE 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12" />Na ameh ata nza ma a buti bleh reh, Nnoh ka a vuru a tsana mboh la a bu tsifa ikpi amoh ŋoh nza a nga mboh tsifa reh kpeh, neh ka a bu tsifa amohnoh mi. Nehnehreh neh Huru Zanana ata Nnoh nza a tohmoh anyi inza, ma a vuru a tsana noh awumu mboh nambri nimeh tsifa nana ata nza ma ahwra a bleh noh. awumu amboh ata areh, ka wa amboh tohmoh Nnoh mboh nza ma a kira la mata a nza wina.<verse eid="1PE 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bu Na Zana Agohsoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13" />Dehreh za, tuma gya noh agohsoh tsifa ndohmoh, de noh ikpi amohnoh, ti gya noh agohsoh amohnoh gaga ma ikpi andromboh lisa alindeh ata nza ma a nati a nga noh na ameh ata Yeso Kristi a nati a gyuru a ba. <verse eid="1PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14" />tuma noh tswanza mara amboh sere tsifa Nnoh, kama kira nnoh la awumu agugu mboh amboh ata nza tini kǝ kira nnoh ni kiri ta a fira nnoh agohsoh kpeh. Na ameh wohroh tini kǝ tre bu noh ma shini. <verse eid="1PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15" />Neh tswanza Nnoh nza a fi noh reh a zanana, mohnoh za dehreh bu noh na zanana nimeh andromboh nza ni lisa noh reh nambri; <verse eid="1PE 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16" />tsifa la tama a ŋa ma amgbasho Nnoh la: &lt;&lt;Bu nnoh na zanana kanga, tsifa la mya meh bu zanana.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1PE 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17" />mohnoh nza ni kǝ fi noh Nnoh la Ada ma atsi kwere Nnoh. Bu ŋoh mi akyo hwra akpi, ata nza ka a tsana kira ikpi kpeh na ameh ata nza ka ahwra akpi ma kyangwri yehlehleh na ndohmoh a ŋoh. kǝ hende noh na nyiri a gu na a te ibi ata nza ma a nati a treh tuma sene amohnoh ata inziyo agba areh. <verse eid="1PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18" />Ni wina noh la ma tana a sa noh a hwana anyi ma aki tufa awumu wusu ata ada amohnoh mboh na kiri tama ata nnoh gohmoh reh. Ma a sohroh a sa noh a hwa na na awumu amboh ata nza ma a nati te abibi tswanza kpakpa hungroh atisha tasa kpakpa hungroh atasaa kpeh, <verse eid="1PE 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19" />Na ajija imya Yeso Kristi neh, ata nza a tswa nza ameh atashi ata koro ata nza a bu na kpra kpeh, ata nza a bu na bishi kpeh. <verse eid="1PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20" />Nnoh Tana a seh ŋoh feh ma sa a lisa inziyo agba reh, neh bu tsifa amohnoh nza ma a vuru ŋoh a tsana na ameh trina. <verse eid="1PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21" />Ka anyi na a ŋoh nza ni nga agohsoh ma Nnoh, ata nza a yiri ŋoh anyi kwo, ta ka a nga ŋoh agba, la nga agohsoh amohnoh tasa nga agohsoh amohnoh mata a bu na Nnoh.<verse eid="1PE 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22" />nehnehreh nza ni hwara nnoh ahroh amohnoh mboh keh zanana ma aki sehreh ma zizi ni kǝ kira nnoh na atsi amohnoh mboh na kira ata a zizi, kǝ rya nnoh tohmoh na kira nnoh na itoh amohnoh ma a zizi na agohsoh amohnoh anyimbehreh. <verse eid="1PE 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23" />La maa a gyuru a mara nnoh na afri, a bu ata ika ata te abibi maka a hunji kpeh, neh fene amohnoh afeh reh a nati a tuma atono tsifa la anyi na tsifa Nnoh ata nza ka a trina kpeh. <verse eid="1PE 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24" />Amgbasho Nnoh</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">&lt;&lt;Kyangwri mboh nambri tswanza bini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 1:24">tasa ma agba amoh nambri a bu tswanza akru mboh ma aye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">bini reh a ka a hwara tasa akru mboh maka a kpokprona, <verse eid="1PE 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25" />tsifa ata Ada reh neh a ka a tuma atono.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 1:25">Areh ka a bu ŋoh tsifa nana ata ma ta ka ahwra a bleh noh reh.<verse eid="1PE 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2" />
  <para style="s">Kpakpa Ata Chuhu Ida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1" />Nza ka bu dehreh, fufa nnoh nambri tsifa de ma agohsoh, tasa huru tsifa, tasa bleh nyi, tasa te vene, tasa kputu sa ha bu ika atamaa. <verse eid="1PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2" />Tswanza amehreh atisha mboh, te nnoh iko amwo behneh ata huru, la ma aki wa amwo behneh reh, ni nati te nnoh agba ti hunji noh nvara. <verse eid="1PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:3" />Tswanza nza bu ŋa gyaa nimeh amgbasho reh la, &lt;&lt;mohnoh ni nza wina noh la Ada reh a zohhoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kristi reh A tswanza Kpakpa Ata Chuhu Ida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4" />Tswanza ni kǝ ba nnoh na Yeso ŋoh nza a tswanza Kpakpa ata nza a bu na fene reh, kyangwri mboh tama a leke ŋoh, Nnoh neh ka a seh ŋoh a bu ajija na a ŋoh, <verse eid="1PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5" />mohnoh za ni bu noh tswanza kpakpa chuhu da reh, ata Nnoh ka a te ndohmoh na amoh la mata a mina afiya a ŋoh reh, la ti bu noh tswanza firistochi a ŋoh mboh ata nza maka nga ŋoh awumu nana agohsoh ata Nnoh ta a sa ma aki Yeso Kristi. <verse eid="1PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6" />Amgbasho Nnoh reh a bleh la:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">&lt;&lt;Nza, mya meh seh kpakpa ata nza a zohhoh reh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">ata mya nza ni gu gya la ta bu kpakpa chuhu ida ma Sihiyona.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">tasa akyo ata nza a sa tsifa a ŋoh a kira reh, ma a nati a nga ŋoh sa kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1PE 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7" />Nehnehreh na amohnoh amboh nga agohsoh reh, kpakpa reh a bu ajija. Na amboh neh nza ma a nga agohsoh kpeh reh,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:7">&lt;&lt;Kpakpa ata amboh mina tama a leke reh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:7">a bu wohroh a gyuruna a bu kpakpa ata amboh mina nza ma a kira a keh mgbiri reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1PE 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8" />Amgbasho reh anyi a bleh za la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:8">&lt;&lt;A bu kpakpa reh a nati a de kyangwri mboh a kpa hwana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:8">tasa kpakpa reh za a nati a de mboh a hwa.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 2:8">Ma a kpa hwana tsifa la ma a leke mata a sa tsifa Nnoh reh a kira, ata ma ta ka a lisa a gya tsifa amoh reh.<verse eid="1PE 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9" />mohnoh neh ni bu noh kyangwri amboh ata Nnoh nza a seh nnoh, tasa amboh dohsoh ikpi firistochi ata Nnoh Agohmoh Agba, akpo inzi ata zanana, tasa kyangwri Nnoh mboh la ti hwra nnoh agbugba ndohmoh a ŋoh mboh ata shi ŋara aniye ma ata nza a fi noh a kate anyi ma hohroh shini, ni kǝ niye nnoh nimeh zana a ŋoh ata shi ŋara aniye ma. <verse eid="1PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10" />Na amehmeh reh, tini bu noh kyangwri Nnoh mboh kpeh, nehnehreh neh ni bu noh kyangwri Nnoh mboh. Na amehmeh reh tini hehreh hunji noh kwini Nnoh kpeh, nehnehreh neh ni kǝ hunji noh kwini a ŋoh reh.<verse eid="1PE 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahwra Nnoh Mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11" />Iziza amya mboh meh nza kira na amoh reh, meh kwere nnoh, la mohnoh ni bu noh sene mboh ma inziyo areh, ni bu noh na afiya kpeh ma areh, ti kpi nnoh ikpi amohnoh kate nyi nnoh ma agohsoh te iyo ata kyangwri. Agohsoh ata areh a buti te gofo na fene amohnoh. <verse eid="1PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12" />Hende ma aki alindeh ma hohroh amboh ata nza ma a tufa Nnoh kpeh, nza ma a kya nnoh la mohnoh ni bu noh agugu mboh reh, mata a nza lisa alindeh amohnoh reh mata ariri Nnoh ibi ata ŋoh nza a nati a ba reh.<verse eid="1PE 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13" />Nga noh agba ma amboh ata hwra akpi mboh, amboh ata nza ma a bu na wuwana ma ikpi amohnoh. Nga noh agba ma Agohmoh agbaa ŋoh ata nza a de kyangwri mboh nambri, <verse eid="1PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14" />ha ma amboh de kpra agbugba mboh, ata nza bu Agohmoh nza a tohmoh mboh la ma ta ka a nga iya ma amboh nza maka a lisa andromboh ata nza a bu yehlehleh kpeh, mata ringa amboh nza maka a lisa andromboh ata nza a bu yehlehleh. <verse eid="1PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15" />A bu kohnoh Nnoh mi la ti lisa andromboh ata nza a bu yehlehleh ma tohmoh amboh nza ma a bu na lomo kpeh, la ti hama nnoh tsifa duduna nza maka atsifa nimeh kyangwri mboh nza ma a bu nimeh shini. <verse eid="1PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16" />tuma noh tswanza kyangwri mboh nza ma a hunji gǝga inyo, neh kama gu nnoh hunji gǝga inyo reh hama nnoh tohmoh ti kǝ te nnoh agugu; tuma noh tswanza ni bu noh ahwra mboh ata Nnoh. <verse eid="1PE 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17" />Tsana nnoh nga agba amohnoh ma kyangwri mboh nambri, kira nnoh na ambohroh mboh amboh tufa Yeso. Nyiri nnoh Nnoh. Nga noh agba ma Agohmoh agbaa.<verse eid="1PE 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wa Iya Kristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18" />mohnoh ahwra mboh nga nnoh ikpi amohnoh ma agbugba kyangwri afiya amohnoh mboh na nga agba, na amboh nza ma a lisa nnoh alindeh ha amboh nza ma a bu na kuku ikpi tsene kpeh, neh ka wa ma amboh gofo mboh. <verse eid="1PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19" />Nnoh a nati a te nnoh atoh tsifa ata areh, nza ni shi wuwana ti wa iya ma ikpi kpakpana ata nza bu anzoh kpeh reh, a lisa dehreh la ha a bu na kira Nnoh. <verse eid="1PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20" />Nza neh ni kǝ lisa nnoh andromboh ata nza a zohhoh kpeh Agba kyangwri anzoh ka a gohroh nnoh, ha ni de ikpi ahroh amohnoh wuwa noh ni bu noh na firoh andromboh na amohnoh ma a huru kpeh. Nza ni kǝ te noh ndohmoh alindeh, neh ni kǝ wa nnoh iya ma ikpi, ni kǝ soh nnoh ivoh yira, wohroh ka a bu andromboh ata Nnoh nza a kira. <verse eid="1PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21" />La bu tsifa iya ikata areh nza ma a fi noh. tsifa la Yeso Kristi za a wa iya tsifa amohnoh. ka ata nnoh la a bu dehreh za, ni nati tufa nnoh a hwana a ŋoh mboh.<verse eid="1PE 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22" />&lt;&lt;Ŋoh a mishi a kpakpana kpeh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:22">tasa ma a mishi a hunji huru tsifa nyi ma aniye a ŋoh kpeh. &gt;&gt;<verse eid="1PE 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23" />Nza ma a kya ŋoh a sohroh a vuru aniye kpeh; nza a wa iya, ka a bleh ŋoh a nati lisa mboh heri kpeh, a ka lisa a gya agohsoh a ŋoh na Nnoh nza ka ahwra akpi ata a zizi. <verse eid="1PE 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24" />Mbohroh meh kpakpana ma kristi, ŋoh ka a gu kpakpana ambohroh ma itoh a ŋoh nza ma a kohhroh ŋoh ma gbohrohgboh, la ma ikpi kwo a ŋoh reh Mbohroh za meh ti tswanza amboh kwo ma aki kpakpana reh, meh ti tufa aki yehlehleh. A bu aki bla a ŋoh reh Mbohroh meh ti hunji wuwana. <verse eid="1PE 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25" />Ni kiri tini bleh noh tswanza atashi mboh, nehnehreh neh gyuruna ba nnoh na kyangwri sumu tasa kyangwri nza fene amohnoh mboh.<verse eid="1PE 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3" />
  <para style="s1">Tuma Afya Mboh Ma Atsifa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1" />ifiya mboh, a bu dehreh za nga noh ikpi amohnoh ma tsifa amohnoh mboh, la nza akyo amoh anyi a sohroh a nga agohsoh na tsifa Nnoh kpeh reh, la handuhwa ma aki lisa agohsoh alindeh ata ifiya amoh mboh, Nnoh ka akpi mboh a ba, ha akyo atsifa na amoh kpeh. <verse eid="1PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:2" />Nza maka a nza zana agohsoh amohnoh tasa kuku ikpi amohnoh, mata a gyuruna. <verse eid="1PE 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3" />Jimi amohnoh ta a kama bu ata itoh tsene kpeh, tswanza cha ikpi mboh, tasa jimi kpakpa hungroh atisha, tasa akuri mboh ata wi. <verse eid="1PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4" />Ta jimi amohnoh ta a bu ata nza anyi nimeh agohsoh, jimi amohnoh reh ta bu ata kuku ikpi tasa ata de ikpi, ata nza a bu ajija gaga ma tohmoh Nnoh. <verse eid="1PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5" />Ni kiri a bu dehreh ifiya amboh nza ma a keshe ikpi amoh mboh a gya na zanana ma Nnoh, amboh nza ma a gya agohsoh amoh na a ŋoh za ma a jimi ikpi amoh, ma ta ka a nga ikpi amoh ma tsifa amoh mboh, <verse eid="1PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6" />tswanza Saratu a nga ikpi a ŋoh ma atsifa a ŋoh Ibrahim, a ka a fi ŋoh la agba afiya a ŋoh. mohnoh za, ni bu noh nyifa a ŋoh mboh ata a zizi nza ni te ndohmoh alindeh, nza ni kira nnoh la andromboh ta a nga noh nyiri kpeh. <verse eid="1PE 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7" />Tsifa mboh, bu dehreh za tuma noh alindeh ma ifiya amohnoh mboh, nga bu noh agba amoh, tasa za ti nza noh la mboh reh ma bu na wuwana tswanza mohnoh reh kpeh. mohnoh tasa ifiya amohnoh mboh nambri ti dohsohna hunji noh gohmoh lisa alindeh ata fene na Nnoh. Lisa nnoh dehreh la andromboh ta kama a ha nnoh kwere amohnoh mboh.<verse eid="1PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wa Iya Ma Ikpi Lisa Andromboh Alindeh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8" />Ma trina za, nambri ma amohnoh, dohsoh nnoh agohsoh amohnoh ta bu anyimbehreh. ti kǝ nza noh kwini itoh amohnoh, tasa za kǝ kira nnoh ambohroh mboh, kǝ tsana agohsoh shingi itoh amohnoh bu na gu ikpi ka kpeh. <verse eid="1PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9" />Kama fanga agugu na agugu kpeh ha kya na kya kpeh, neh ta a bu na te atoh, tana a bu tsifa ata areh mi Nnoh a fi noh. A gu ma agohsoh a ŋoh la mohnoh na ikpi amohnoh ti hunji noh te atoh. <verse eid="1PE 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10" />Ma a ŋa la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">&gt;&gt; Akyo ata nza a kira ta a nza nana fene</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">akyo ata nza a kira ta nza ibi alilehndeh mboh,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">ta ta a de arimi ŋoh kanga nyi ma aki te inyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">ta ta a de aniye a ŋoh Ma huru tsifa.<verse eid="1PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11" />A nati a gyuruna kanga anyi ma aki te agugu tasa ta ka a lisa alindeh;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:11">a nati bu kanga la ta a fa tuma alindeh na itoh ŋoh nambri.<verse eid="1PE 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12" />iyo Ada a bu ma ikpi amboh ata nza ma a tufa yehlehleh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">tasa ashotoh a ŋoh mboh ma bu ti sere kwere amoh mboh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">ŋoh neh a leke na amboh ata nza ma a te agugu reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1PE 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13" />Nza ni yiyina nnoh ma aki tufa andromboh ata nza a bu alindeh, akyo a nati lisa nnoh andromboh kpeh. <verse eid="1PE 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14" />Nza neh ni kǝ wa iya tsifa te ndohmoh alindeh, mohnoh ni bu noh kyangwri te atoh mboh mi. Nza ka bu dehreh kama nyiri nnoh amboh nza ma a nati a te nnoh inyi kpeh, tasa za kama kohnoh nnoh na amoh kpeh. <verse eid="1PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15" />mohnoh neh ti nga nnoh agba ma Yeso kristi ma agohsoh amohnoh ti kira nnoh la ŋoh bu Ada mi. Ti tuma bana nnoh na tutu atsi tsana noh ma nambri akyo ata nza luhu la ka bu tsifa mboh nza ni fi noh agohsoh amohnoh ma aki tufa Yeso Kristi. Lisa neh na kuku ikpi tasa na nga agba. <verse eid="1PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16" />Ti lisa nza noh la ni lisa noh andromboh ata nza bu yehlehleh. la nza ma a kya nnoh, amboh nza maka a kputu sa amohnoh ma ikpi ajija agohsoh amohnoh mboh nimeh Yeso Kristi, ta a te mboh na sa. <verse eid="1PE 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17" />A nati keh zohhoh, nza a bu Nnoh a gu ma agohsoh a ŋoh dehreh, la ti wa iya ma ikpi andromboh ata nza a bu yehlehleh, la ha ti wa nnoh iya ma ikpi andromboh ata nza a bu yehlehleh kpeh. <verse eid="1PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18" />La Yeso Kristi za a kwo lo anyimbehreh ma, la ŋoh ta a gu kpakpana ambohroh, ata lisa alindeh, la a fira reh a na na Nnoh. Tama a mla ŋoh a kwo kakende, neh ka a gyuru a bu na fene nimeh huru, <verse eid="1PE 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19" />ŋoh nza ka a bu nimeh huru reh, ka a na ma atsi huru mboh nza ma a yama nimeh ida ka, ka ahwra tsifa Nnoh a bleh mboh. <verse eid="1PE 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20" />Huru mboh reh ma bu amboh na kiri tama a sohroh a tufa tsifa Nnoh kpeh, Nnoh a soh ivoh yira na amoh dehreh na ameh ata Anuhu ta ka a buti lisa gbogblondo amwo. Na ameh wohroh tana a bu kyangwri mboh shidi ma tama anvara ma amwo reh, tana bu kyangwri atsiyatsiya ma. <verse eid="1PE 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21" />Amwo reh a tswanza wra batisma ata nza nga noh nvara nehnehreh reh. Nvara reh neh ata nza meh hunji reh a bu tsifa hwara arishi kate nyi ma itoh ambohroh mi kpeh, neh ka a bu ata aki kwere Nnoh meh ti bu na gya agohsoh la kohnoh ambohroh a nati de reh na kpakpana kpeh tsifa hinga Yeso Kristi nyi ma kwo. <verse eid="1PE 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22" />Yeso Kristi kǝ na a ŋoh inza. Ka a tuma na ivoh rya a kpa Nnoh, atsi ata mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh nza ma a de kpra Agohmoh mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh tasa wuwana ata inza na a ŋoh.<verse eid="1PE 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4" />
  <para style="s1">Tuma Ma Nnoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1" />Nza a bu dehreh Yeso Kristi a wa iya ma itoh a ŋoh, mohnoh za gu nnoh kohnoh ika ata areh la ti de noh ikpi ahroh wuwana nnoh na wa iya reh. Akyo ata nza a wa iya ata itoh za reh, a nati kpakpana za kpeh. <verse eid="1PE 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2" />Tsifa wohroh reh, neh a treh a bu na fene ata itoh, andromboh ata nza a nati a tsana ŋoh aki reh a bu kira Nnoh, a sohroh a bu kira ata itoh kpeh. <verse eid="1PE 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3" />mohnoh tini keh yanda nnoh ni kiri reh ma atsi lisa awumu ika ata amboh nza ma a wina Nnoh kpeh tama ka a lisa reh, fa nza nana ata te na isa, tasa hwa amwo iyo ata itoh, tasa te fya, tasa kira hende wa te fya, tasa kate hende wa inyo abibi, tasa tufa nnoh akǝkehreh mboh, ma bu awumu isa nambri. <verse eid="1PE 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4" />nehnehreh neh iziza amohnoh mboh ata kiri reh a ka a te mboh shi ŋara aniye ma nza ma a nza la ni za dohsoh noh ikpi na amoh kpeh nimeh lisa awumu inyi ata kiri kpeh, tasa maka a kya nnoh. <verse eid="1PE 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5" />Ma a nati bleh ikpi amoh ma tomo Nnoh, ata nza a tuma a bana ta ahwra ma kyangwri amboh nza ma a bu na fene tasa ma amboh nza ma a kwo. <verse eid="1PE 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6" />A bu tsifa ata areh ma hwra tsifa nana reh za a bleh ma amboh ata nza ma a kwo reh, la ha tama ahwra mboh akpi nimeh itoh tswanza mgbiri kyangwri mboh, ma a nati wina nvara nimeh huru tswanza Nnoh.<verse eid="1PE 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">amboh Te Ndohmoh Reh Yelele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7" />Trina awumu reh nambri kǝ ba nda. Nza a bu dehreh tuma kya nnoh iyo ma akpo anyimbehreh kanga ti de noh ikpi amohnoh, la ti wina kwere nnoh Nnoh. <verse eid="1PE 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8" />Ata nza a keh nambri, kira nnoh na itoh amohnoh gaga, la kira ka a hama kpakpana mboh gaga. <verse eid="1PE 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9" />Ti kǝ sa nnoh itoh amohnoh nimeh afiyafiya amohnoh mboh, ti kama tsifa nnoh alulu kpeh. <verse eid="1PE 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10" />Nnoh a nga ngǝnga ma kyangwri mboh reh ma atsetse la mata a shingi itoh amoh. Nza a bu dehreh reh, te noh ndohmoh na ngǝnga ata nza ni sa nnoh wusu nyi nnoh na Nnoh reh, <verse eid="1PE 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11" />Akyo ata nza a bu na ngǝnga bleh tsifa Nnoh ta atsifa tswanza a bu Nnoh mi na ikpi a ŋoh atsifa anyi na a ŋoh. Nza ngǝnga akyo bu te ndohmoh Nnoh ta a te na wuwana ata Nnoh nza a nga ŋoh, tsifa la nimeh awumu mboh nambri ma a nga Nnoh agba nimeh Yeso Kristi. Nga agba a bu na a ŋoh tasa wuwana a gu a na tuma atono. Avoh dehreh.<verse eid="1PE 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wa Iya Tsifa Tufa Yeso Kristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12" />Iziza amya mboh ata mya nza ni kira na amoh gaga reh, kama ŋara nnoh aniye ma ikpi iya agba ata nza a nati a ba na amohnoh reh kpeh, a hunji noh la mata a tsara nnoh. Kama gu nnoh la bu andromboh afeh a hunji noh kpeh. <verse eid="1PE 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13" />Te atoh a bu na amohnoh za ni bu noh nimeh wa iya ata Yeso Kristi reh, la agohsoh amohnoh ta a nana tasa ti johjoh nnoh gaga na ameh ata nza ma a nati tsana agba a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="1PE 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14" />Nza ma a kya nnoh tsifa sa Kristi, te atoh a bu amohnoh, la Huru nga agba tasa Huru Nnoh a bu na amohnoh. <verse eid="1PE 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15" />Nza ni wa nnoh iya, ta kama a bu la ni bu kyangwri mla kyangwri mboh kwo kpeh ha ni bu ayuhu ha ni bu kyangwri te mgbiri ndohmoh agugu mboh, ha tswanza kyangwri hende soh aniye ma tsifa mgbiri kyangwri mboh ata nza a bu a ŋoh kpeh. <verse eid="1PE 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16" />Nza neh ni wa iya tsifa la ni bu amboh tufa Yeso, kama kwo sa kpeh tsifa wohroh kpeh, za kǝ nga agba ma Nnoh tsifa sa ata areh. <verse eid="1PE 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17" />La ameh kǝ ba ata ma a nati ahwra akpi ma kyangwri Nnoh mboh, ma a nati a jiji ahwra akpi ma kyangwri Nnoh mboh. Nza ka a jiji na ambohroh reh, a nati ka bu lele na amboh ata nza ma a sa tsifa nana Nnoh reh a kira kpeh? <verse eid="1PE 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18" />Tswanza nza bu ŋa gyaa nimeh amgbasho Nnoh reh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 4:18">&lt;&lt;A nati a bu na iya na kyangwri alilehndeh mboh mata a hunji nvara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 4:18">a nati ka bu lele na amboh kpakpana mboh amboh ata ma a tufa Nnoh yehlehleh kpeh reh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1PE 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19" />Nza a bu dehreh, amboh nza maka wa iya tswanza Nnoh nza a gu ma agohsoh a ŋoh, ta maka a lisa andromboh nza a bu yehlehleh, mata a nga fene amoh ma ivoh Nnoh ata nza a nga mboh fene.<verse eid="1PE 4:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5" />
  <para style="s1">Na Agbugba Mboh Tasa Kafa Kyangwri Mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1" />Mya Abitrusu meh ŋa ba na agbugba mboh nimeh amohnoh, meh kwere tswanza atohngoh amohnoh agba kyangwri. Mya za meh nza na iyo amya iya ata Kristi nza a wa reh, tasa za akyo ata nza a nati hunji avu gafa nimeh nga agba nza ma a nati a vuru tsana ibi ata ba a ŋoh reh. Meh kwere nnoh <verse eid="1PE 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2" />sumu nnoh vara ata Nnoh nza a nga noh reh, ti bu noh agbugba amoh mboh. Kama nza noh la a bu kanga la ti lisa kpeh, Lisa neh na kira agohsoh amohnoh anyimbehreh tswanza Nnoh nza a kira. Neh kama te noh ndohmoh anyi la ti hunji noh hungroh kpeh, te neh la ni nga nnoh agohsoh amohnoh atsi te ndohmoh reh. <verse eid="1PE 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3" />Kama bu noh amboh tsana wuwana ma kyangwri mboh ata Nnoh nza nga noh reh kpeh, mohnoh neh ti bu noh amboh ata vara reh ma a nati a nza anyi na amoh. <verse eid="1PE 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4" />Na ameh ata Yeso a nati ba reh, ni nati sa nnoh gbama ata nga agba ata nza a nati kpokprona kpeh.<verse eid="1PE 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5" />Kafa kyangwri mboh, ma aki wohroh nga nnoh agba ma amboh nza ma a bu agbugba na amohnoh reh. Nambri ma amohnoh nza noh ikpi amohnoh na kuku ikpi ma itoh amohnoh, la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 5:5">&lt;&lt;Nnoh a leke na amboh gu ikpi a ka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 5:5">neh a lisa andromboh alindeh a ŋoh ma amboh kuku ikpi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1PE 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6" />Nza a bu dehreh, Kuku nnoh ikpi amohnoh, ma hohroh ivoh wuwana ata Nnoh, la ta a gu nnoh a ka na ameh ata nza a zohhoh ŋoh reh. <verse eid="1PE 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7" />Gu nnoh iya amohnoh nambri nga nnoh, tsifa la bu ŋoh mi ata sumu nnoh.<verse eid="1PE 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8" />De nnoh ikpi amohnoh, tuma bana nnoh na lla. Iza ata nza a kira na anzoh kpeh agugu reh a tswanza gehgreh a kpanga a hehndeh a fa akyo ata ŋoh ta hwahwashi a rya. <verse eid="1PE 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9" />Neh kama nga noh avoh kpeh, shi wuwana nnoh nimeh nga agohsoh amohnoh, la ni wina noh amohnoh mboh ma inziyo agba areh mboh za ma buti wa iya mboh dehreh. <verse eid="1PE 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10" />Ma nyina neh ameh iya mboh ata nza ni wa nnoh reh, Nnoh ata nza lisa alindeh nambri reh, ata ŋoh nimeh Kristi a fi noh a ba ma nga agba a ŋoh a gu a na na tuma atono, ŋoh ni ikpi a ŋoh a nati gyuru nnoh a te ti bu noh ni susu nnoh, a nati gya nnoh a wuwa, a nati a nga noh chuhu ata wuwana. <verse eid="1PE 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11" />Wuwana mboh nambri ma a bu na a ŋoh a gu a na na tuma atono tasa atono. Avoh dehreh.<verse eid="1PE 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsifa Na Amohnoh Ata Trinaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12" />Na shingi Silbanus meh ŋa ameh amgbasho ata areh ba nnoh, ata na nza amya a tswa ta mata a bleh ŋoh la a bu atsi nimeh nga agohsoh, meh ŋa shidi ba nnoh, meh ti nga nnoh wuwa agohsoh tasa la areh bu a zizi lisa alindeh ata Nnoh. Shi wuwana nnoh nimeh a ŋoh. <verse eid="1PE 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13" />amboh tufa mboh nza ma a bu ma Babila, ata nza a bu atsi a seh, a tohmoh a ba la mata atsifa na amohnoh. tasa za, amehreh amya Markus. <verse eid="1PE 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14" />Tsifa nnoh na itoh amohnoh na na kira alindeh ika ata amboh tufa mboh.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 5:14">Ta Nnoh ta nga noh tuma alindeh nambri ma amohnoh nza ni yama nnoh nimeh Kristi reh.<verse eid="1PE 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5" />
</usx>